    },
    {
      "Uid": 27,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_PF_41_NOA_BT_DEFEAT",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "하지만 이것 또한 네가 선택한 길이니 어쩔 수 없지.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "だけど、これもまた貴方が選んだ道よ。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 28,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_PF_41_NOA_BT_DEFEAT",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "걱정하지 마. ",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "心配はいらないわ。 ",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 29,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_PF_41_NOA_BT_DEFEAT",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "추위가 깊어진 만큼 언젠가 세상을 비출 새로운 별이 나타날 테니까.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "寒さが深まった分、いつか世界を照らす新しい星が現れるはずよ。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 30,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_PF_41_NOA_BT_DEFEAT",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "네가 약속했던 대로.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "貴方が約束したように。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 31,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_PF_41_NOA_BT_DEFEAT",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "그러니까 지금은 잠시나마 편히 쉬렴.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "だから今は、しばらくゆっくり休んで。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 32,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_PF_41_NOA_BT_DEFEAT",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "나의 벗, 나의 계약자…",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "私の友、私の契約者…",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 33,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_PF_41_NOA_BT_DEFEAT",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "그리고 나의… 구원자님.",
